---

---

<section class="relative isolate min-h-[78vh] overflow-hidden bg-navy text-white">
  <img
    src="/images/hero.jpg"
    alt="Vanlife on an open road through mountains"
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
  />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy/90 via-navy/75 to-navy/35"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy/50 via-transparent to-navy/20"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto flex min-h-[78vh] max-w-6xl flex-col justify-center px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <p
      class="mb-5 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-mint"
    >
      A vanlife note from Beatriz & Eelco
    </p>
    <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
      Leave it cleaner than you found it.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85 sm:text-xl">
      We love vanlife. We love park4night. After more than eight years on the road we keep finding
      more littered parking places — and we want to keep enjoying those nights for many years to
      come.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="#gear"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-mint px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy shadow-lg transition hover:bg-mint-dark"
      >
        Shop cleaning gear
      </a>
      <a
        href="#instagram"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition hover:bg-white/20"
      >
        Share #clean4park
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
